!Name: x-oscs-1-of-each
!COne-of-each collection of every known oscillator
!Cperiod up to 61. All periods 61 and over can be
!Cachieved using herschel loops.
!C(*) One asterisk (tub) means no such oscillator is
!Cknown.
!C(**) Two means it has only been achieved in the very
!Ctrivial sense, with no cells that oscillate at the full
!Cperiod.
!C(***) Three means that the smallest known oscillator
!Cis very large, and not included in this file.
!C
